      "id": "t_s2_body",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 276,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "Run CASM + inputFile in Cairo VM\nOutput:  execution trace (register state at every step)  |  memory snapshot  |  public output\nIf any assert fails → execution aborts, no proof can be generated",
